OL,3,GNEWSAAsteroids named after scientists
OL,4,Ato recognise work
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo asteroids have been named after
OL,7,Fplanetary scientists in recognition of
OL,8,Ftheir contributions to space research.
OL,10,FDr Beatriz Sanchez-Cano and Dr Daniel
OL,11,FSheward, from the University of
OL,12,FLeicester and Space Park Leicester,
OL,13,Freceived the "incredible honour" from
OL,14,Fthe International Astronomical Union.
OL,16,FAsteroid 20685 Sanchez-Cano recognises
OL,17,FSanchez-Cano's work on space weather
OL,18,Fand planetary atmospheres, and Asteroid
OL,19,F20713 Sheward celebrates Sheward's
OL,20,Fstudy into meteoroid impacts on the
OL,21,FMoon.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
