OL,3,GNEWSAAsteroids named after scientists
OL,4,Ato recognise work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university director said it was one
OL,7,Fof the "most prestigious forms of
OL,8,Frecognition" in the field of astronomy
OL,9,Fas the name becomes "permanently
OL,10,Fassociated with the Solar System".
